CREATE FANCTION TAKE NAME MAIN END TAKE WITH END WITH DO
  CREATE STRING TAKE NAME a END TAKE
  CREATE STRING TAKE NAME b END TAKE
  CHANGE a VALUE TO TAKE NUMBER YOU GOT ME END TAKE
  WHILE TAKE NUMBER 5 END TAKE IS EQUAL TO TAKE NUMBER 5 END TAKE DO
    IF GET a VALUE IS EQUAL TO GET b VALUE DO
      BREAK
      CHANGE b VALUE TO TAKE NUMBER YOU GOT ME BUT BREAK NOT WORKED END TAKE
    END DO
    ELSE IF GET b VALUE IS EQUAL TO TAKE STRING none END TAKE DO
      CHANGE b VALUE TO TAKE STRING YOU GOT ME END TAKE
      CONTINUE
      CHANGE b VALUE TO TAKE STRING YOU GOT ME BUT CONTINUE NOT WORKED END TAKE
    END DO
    ELSE DO
      CHANGE b VALUE TO TAKE STRING none END TAKE
    END DO
  END DO
END DO
